  "details": "So let's say you found a public avatar you really like, everything about it is perfect except for one thing, it has a bunch of annoying particles that drop your frames and get in your way. Well here i present an idea to have the ability to disable said particles, or any other annoying effects, of your own avatar. I'm thinking maybe just a \"Disable particles\" button in the Performance options menu under Safety Settings.",
